[0.008, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m- keeping the engine core fast, lean, and genre independent\u001b[39m                                                           \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m- using existing tools and functionality instead of creating new solutions when possible\u001b[39m                              \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m- open source, fitness for purpose, maintenance, performance\u001b[39m                                                          \r\u001b[1B                                                                                                                        \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mThe plan will be added to the file \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mroadmap.md\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m as a complete section of work, separate to any existing work.\u001b[39m           \r\u001b[1B                                                                                                                        \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mIt will be scheduled separately at first, with notes on where it\u001b[39m                                                      \r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mwi\u001b[6Gl interfere with or rely on any existing roadmap work item.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m                                                                                                                        \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mBreak out detailed analysis and plans into a separate file in the ./docs folder\u001b[39m                                       \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mto prevent roadmap.md becoming over crowded.\u001b[39m                                                                          \r\u001b[1B                                                                                                                        \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mOnce we agree on the plan write out all the decisions, planning, expected issues,\u001b[39m                                     \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mroadmap, milestones, etc. The plan will be cross examined by another AI for completeness, fitness for purpose, \u001b[39m       \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255melegance, functionality, and performance. The code and plan must meet all the expected goals mentioned here and in \u001b[39m   \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mour existing documentation. You should update those existing goals and standards if there is anything that is \u001b[39m        \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255msurfaced by this process that would aid in producing better software and results.\u001b[39m                                     \r\u001b[1B                                                                                                                        \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mThe transcript will be pasted into the terminal in just a moment.\u001b[39m                                                     \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m*\u001b[3GOrchestrating… \r\u001b[3B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[3B\u001b[38;2;255;193;7m⏵⏵ auto mode on\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
