[0.003, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mSearched for \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m pattern, read \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[39m I've read the docs index and the roadmap's structure (J01–J35, five tiers, the \"Current deliveries\" and \"Waiting on\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  you\" sections). Paste the transcript when you're ready.\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  After it arrives I'll:\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  1. Read the transcript and the engine docs and code it touches, which are the ground truth for what exists.\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  2. Interview you in small batches of questions, starting with scope and goals and then the trade-offs. I'll use the\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     existing code and tools wherever they fit.\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  3. Once we agree, write:\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     - the detail in a new \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdocs/\u001b[39m file;\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     - a separate section in \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mroadmap.md\u001b[39m, noting where it overlaps or depends on J01–J35;\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     - decisions, expected issues and milestones;\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B-\u001b[8Gupdates\u001b[16Gto\u001b[19Gthe\u001b[23Gstandards\u001b[33Gor\u001b[36Ggoals\u001b[42Gdocs\u001b[47Gwhere\u001b[53Gthe\u001b[57Gdiscussion\u001b[68Gturns\u001b[74Gup\u001b[77Gsomething\u001b[87Gbetter.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  So far I've only read the docs index and the roadmap headings, nothing else.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GCogitated for 13s ·\u001b[23Gdone \u001b[29G:33 pm\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[3B❯ \r\u001b[41C\u001b[3B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m← 1\u001b[46Gagent\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
