[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m128 vertices / 128 tri\u001b[26Gngles—it\u001b[35Ghits the\u001b[45Gweet \u001b[51Gpot where a single\u001b[70Gcluster fits inside one mesh \u001b[100Ghader workgroup and \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bke\u001b[6Gps CLAS header overhead low.\u001b[39m                                                                                     \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mMemory Pool Fragmen\u001b[23Gation: Streamed clusters load and unlo\u001b[62Gd dynami\u001b[71Gally. Use a\u001b[83Gfixe\u001b[88G-siz\u001b[94Gblock/p\u001b[102Gg\u001b[104G allocat\u001b[113Gr \u001b[39m     \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m(\u001b[5G.g., 4 KB or 16\u001b[21GKB pages) for both your geometry slab and your CLAS output buffer rather than general-purpose \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bsub-allocation, so streaming n\u001b[34Gver stalls on\u001b[48Gdefragmentation.\u001b[39m                                                   \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mCross-Platform\u001b[18GShader Compilation: Compile y\u001b[48Gur Mesh, Task,\u001b[63GC\u001b[65Gmpute, and Fragment shaders with Sla\u001b[102Gg (slangc -target \r\u001b[3C\u001b[1Bpirv) \u001b[11Gr glslangValidator, explicitly targeting --targe\u001b[60G-e\u001b[63Gv vulkan1.4 so SPV_NV_cluster_acceleration_structure and \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BSPV_EXT_mesh_shader validate cleanly on both Linux and Windows.\u001b[39m                                                      \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mWhe\u001b[7Ge w\u001b[11Guld you like to dive in first for your implementation:\u001b[39m                                                       \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mOffline glTF Baking: Setting\u001b[32Gup nv_cluster_builder\u001b[54G+ nv_lo\u001b[62G_cluster_builder in C++ to serialize your custom cluster \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bbinary format\u001b[39m                                                 \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mGPU Memory &\u001b[16GStreaming: Designing the page-\u001b[47Gase\u001b[51G VRAM pool and CLAS address\u001b[79Gcaching sy\u001b[90Gtem\u001b[39m                          \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mShader\u001b[10GC\u001b[12Gde: Writing the Mesh Shader (VK_EXT_mesh_shader) and DAG traversal compute shader?\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\\\u001b[39m                                                                                         \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[39m Searching for \u001b[1m4\u001b[22m patterns, reading \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file, listing \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m directory, running \u001b[1m11\u001b[22m shell commands…\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  $ env \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mVK_ICD_FILENAMES='/nix/store/fippdqspy3i24apvl2rzd4badsa2hgiq-mesa-26.3.1/share/vulkan/icd.d/lvp_icd.x86_64.json' \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mvulkani\u001b[14Gfo\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;44H\u001b[?25h"]
