gRT\u001b[71G\u001b[39mpreset for ray tracing.\u001b[95GNVIDIA's\u001b[104Gown\u001b[108GLOD\u001b[112Gsample\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G(\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mvk_lod_clusters\u001b[39m, Apache-2.0) bui\u001b[39Gd\u001b[41G it\u001b[46Ghierarchy with a ligh\u001b[68Gly modified copy of \u001b[89Gt.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mCluster size:\u001b[22m NVIDIA's animated-clu\u001b[41Gters samp\u001b[51Ge recommends\u001b[64G64 tri\u001b[71Gngles and\u001b[81G64 vertices. That\u001b[99Gcontradicts\u001b[111Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gtranscript's \"128/128\u001b[27Gis the\u001b[35Gweet \u001b[41Gpot\". I'll\u001b[52Gmeasure the size rather than pick one now.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mSample framework:\u001b[22m the\u001b[27GNVIDIA\u001b[34Gsamples\u001b[42Gdepend\u001b[49Gon\u001b[52Gtheir\u001b[58Gown\u001b[62G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mnvpro_core2\u001b[74G\u001b[39mframework.\u001b[85GThey're\u001b[93Greferences\u001b[104Gto\u001b[107Gread,\u001b[113Gnot\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bdependencies\u001b[18Gto\u001b[21Gadd.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BOne thing I haven't se\u001b[26Gtled is whether \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mVK_EXT_cluster_acceleration_structure\u001b[80G\u001b[39mexists\u001b[87Ganywhere:\u001b[97Gthe\u001b[101Gregistry\u001b[110Gpage\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Breturned\u001b[12G403,\u001b[17Gthough\u001b[24Git\u001b[27Gisn't\u001b[33Gon\u001b[36Gthis\u001b[41Gdriver\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
