come\u001b[117Gfrom\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gthe device, not a fix\u001b[27Gd 128. Plain \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mvulkaninfo\u001b[51G\u001b[39mdoes\u001b[56G'\u001b[59Gprint them, so the engine\u001b[85Gwill have to query the\u001b[108G itself.\u001b[117G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mCompiler:\u001b[22m glslang\u001b[23G16.6 compiles a ray query using \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mrayQueryGetIntersectionClusterIdNV\u001b[90G\u001b[39mat our current \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mvulkan1.3\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gtarget. The he\u001b[20Gders (1.4.363) have every s\u001b[48Gmbol.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mRay tracing on lavapipe:\u001b[22m it's\u001b[35Gslow\u001b[40Gfor dense scenes,\u001b[58Gbut\u001b[62Gthe\u001b[66Greference\u001b[76Gviews\u001b[82Gare\u001b[86Gsmall.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mmeshoptimizer v1.3\u001b[22m is MIT. \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mclusterlod.h\u001b[39m ha\u001b[48G a \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mclodDefaultConfigRT\u001b[39m preset for\u001b[82Gray\u001b[86Gtr\u001b[89Gcing.\u001b[95GNVIDIA's\u001b[104Gown\u001b[108GLOD\u001b[112Gsample\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G(\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mvk_lod_clusters\u001b[39m, Apache-2.0) builds its h\u001b[76Gied copy of it.\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
