[0.084, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BWhat\u001b[8Gwould\u001b[14Gyou\u001b[18Glike\u001b[23Gto\u001b[26Gclarify?\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BMeanwhile,\u001b[14Gthe\u001b[18Gchecks\u001b[25Gon\u001b[28Gthe\u001b[32Gtranscript\u001b[43Ghave\u001b[48Gturned\u001b[55Gup:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- \u001b[1mWrong name:\u001b[22m the operation that builds\u001b[43Gan object's\u001b[55Gacceleration\u001b[68Gstructure\u001b[78Gfrom\u001b[83Gits\u001b[87Gclusters\u001b[96Gis\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mVK_CLUSTER_ACCELERATION_STRUCTURE_OP_TYPE_BUILD_CLUSTERS_BOTTOM_LEVEL_NV\u001b[39m, n\u001b[81Gt\u001b[83G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mBUILD_BLAS_FROM_CLUSTERS_NV\u001b[39m.\u001b[112GCluster\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bstructures can't be serialised either, so they're rebuilt on each run and\u001b[79Gcan't be cooked to disk.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mHardware limits:\u001b[22G\u001b[22mthe \u001b[27Gxtension\u001b[36Gis NVIDIA-only and\u001b[55Gnot ra\u001b[62Gified. The per-cluster\u001b[85Gv\u001b[87Grtex and triangle\u001b[105Glimits\u001b[112Gcome\u001b[117Gfrom\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gthe device, not a fix\u001b[27Gd 128. Plain \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mvulkaninfo\u001b[51G\u001b[39mdoes\u001b[56G'\u001b[59Gprint them, so the engine\u001b[85Gwill have to query the\u001b[108G itself.\u001b[117G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mCompiler:\u001b[22m glslang\u001b[23G16.6 compiles a ray query using \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mrayQueryGetIntersectionClusterIdNV\u001b[90G\u001b[39mat our current \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mvulkan1.3\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gtarget. The he\u001b[20Gders (1.4.363) have every s\u001b[48Gmbol.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mRay tracing on lavapipe:\u001b[22m it's\u001b[35Gslow\u001b[40Gfor dense scenes,\u001b[58Gbut\u001b[62Gthe\u001b[66Greference\u001b[76Gviews\u001b[82Gare\u001b[86Gsmall.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mmeshoptimizer v1.3\u001b[22m is MIT. \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mclusterlod.h\u001b[39m ha\u001b[48G a \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mclodDefaultConfigRT\u001b[39m preset for\u001b[82Gray\u001b[86Gtr\u001b[89Gcing.\u001b[95GNVIDIA's\u001b[104Gown\u001b[108GLOD\u001b[112Gsample\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G(\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mvk_lod_clusters\u001b[39m, Apache-2.0) builds its hierarchy with a lightly\u001b[71Gmodified copy of it.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mCluster size:\u001b[22m NVIDIA's animated-c\u001b[39Gu\u001b[41Gter\u001b[46Gsample recommends 64 \u001b[68Griangles and 64 vert\u001b[89Gces.\u001b[94GThat\u001b[99Gcontradicts\u001b[111Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gtranscript's \"128/128 is the sweet \u001b[41Gpot\". I'l\u001b[51G measure the\u001b[64Gsize r\u001b[71Gther than\u001b[81Gpick one now.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mSample framework:\u001b[22m the\u001b[27GNVIDIA\u001b[35Gample\u001b[41G depend on\u001b[52Gtheir own \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mnvpro_core2\u001b[39m framework. They're references\u001b[104Gto\u001b[107Gread,\u001b[113Gnot\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gdependencies to add.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BOne\u001b[7Gthing\u001b[13GI\u001b[15Ghaven't\u001b[23Gsettled\u001b[31Gis\u001b[34Gwhether\u001b[42G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mVK_EX\u001b[76Gure\u001b[80G\u001b[39mexists\u001b[87Ganywhere:\u001b[97Gthe\u001b[101Gregistry\u001b[110Gpage\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;53H\u001b[?25h"]
