[0.502, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G \u001b[5Gthe device, not a fix\u001b[27Gd 128. Plain \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mvulkaninfo\u001b[51G\u001b[39mdoes\u001b[56G'\u001b[59Gprint them, so the engine\u001b[85Gwill have to query the\u001b[108G itself.\u001b[117G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mCompiler:\u001b[22m glslang\u001b[23G16.6 compiles a ray query using \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mrayQueryGetIntersectionClusterIdNV\u001b[90G\u001b[39mat our current \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mvulkan1.3\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gtarget. The he\u001b[20Gders (1.4.363) have every s\u001b[48Gmbol.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mRay tracing on lavapipe:\u001b[22m it's\u001b[35Gslow\u001b[40Gfor dense scenes,\u001b[58Gbut\u001b[62Gthe\u001b[66Greference\u001b[76Gviews\u001b[82Gare\u001b[86Gsmall.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mmeshoptimizer v1.3\u001b[22m is MIT. \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mclusterlod.h\u001b[39m ha\u001b[48G a \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mclodDefaultConfigRT\u001b[39m preset for\u001b[82Gray\u001b[86Gtr\u001b[89Gcing.\u001b[95GNVIDIA's\u001b[104Gown\u001b[108GLOD\u001b[112Gsample\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G(\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mvk_lod_clusters\u001b[39m, Apache-2.0) builds its hierarchy with a lightly\u001b[71Gmodified copy of it.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mCluster size:\u001b[22m NVIDIA's animated-c\u001b[39Gu\u001b[41Gter\u001b[46Gsample recommends 64 \u001b[68Griangles and 64 vert\u001b[89Gces.\u001b[94GThat\u001b[99Gcontradicts\u001b[111Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gtranscript's \"128/128 is the sweet \u001b[41Gpot\". I'l\u001b[51G measure the\u001b[64Gsize r\u001b[71Gther than\u001b[81Gpick one now.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mSample framework:\u001b[22m the\u001b[27GNVIDIA\u001b[35Gample\u001b[41G depend on\u001b[52Gtheir own \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mnvpro_core2\u001b[39m framework. They're references\u001b[104Gto\u001b[107Gread,\u001b[113Gnot\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gdependencies to add.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BOne\u001b[7Gthing\u001b[13GI\u001b[15Ghaven't\u001b[23Gsettled\u001b[31Gis\u001b[34Gwhether\u001b[42G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mVK_EXT_cluster_acceleration_structure\u001b[80G\u001b[39mexists\u001b[87Ganywhere:\u001b[97Gthe\u001b[101Gregistry\u001b[110Gpage\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Breturned 403, though i\u001b[26G isn't on this driver either way.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GBrewed for 2m 7s · done 8:38 pm\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;136;136;136m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── jettison-0030 ─\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m❯ How costly is ray traced reflections, and what impact would it have on the engine. Can it be offered as an optional\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  extra path\u001b[14Gfor rendering\u001b[28Gand disabled\u001b[41Gwhen needed. I would l\u001b[64Gke it if the impact isn't\u001b[90Gtoo strong.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BIs there a\u001b[14Gway\u001b[18Gto have the mega stuff\u001b[42Gork\u001b[46Gon AMD hardware, an equivalent\u001b[77GAPI / SDK? If n\u001b[93Gt \u001b[96Ghe\u001b[99G it\u001b[103Gneeds\u001b[109Gto\u001b[112Gbe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Boptional\u001b[12Gwithin the r\u001b[25Gnderer.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BWhy are we on vulkan 1.3? A\u001b[31Ge\u001b[33Gthere\u001b[39Gadvantages\u001b[50Gto\u001b[53Gmoving\u001b[60Gto\u001b[63G1.4\u001b[67Gand\u001b[71Gwill\u001b[76Gthat\u001b[81Gmove\u001b[86Gbreak\u001b[92Ganything\u001b[101Gin\u001b[104Gthe\u001b[108Gcodebase?\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BSample framework - \u001b[23Goted.\u001b[30Glso r\u001b[36Gs\u001b[38Garch o\u001b[45Gher samples from nvidi\u001b[68G, and anything AMD has to offer.\u001b[101G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
