[0.004, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mRay tracing on lavapipe:\u001b[22m it's slow\u001b[40Gfor dense scenes, but the r\u001b[68Gference vi\u001b[79Gws are small.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mmeshoptimizer v1.3\u001b[22m is MIT. \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mclusterlod.h\u001b[39m has\u001b[49Ga \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mclodDefa\u001b[60GltConfigRT\u001b[39m preset for ray tracing. NVIDIA's own LOD sample\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B(\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mvk_lod_clusters\u001b[39m, Apache-2.0\u001b[35Gbuilds its\u001b[46Ghierarchy\u001b[56Gwith\u001b[61Ga\u001b[63Glightly\u001b[71Gmodified\u001b[80Gcopy\u001b[85Gof\u001b[88Git.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mClus\u001b[10Ger size:\u001b[22m NVIDIA's an\u001b[31Gmated-clusters sample r\u001b[55Gcommends 64 triangl\u001b[75Gs and 64 vertices.\u001b[94GThat\u001b[99Gcontradicts\u001b[111Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gtranscript's \"128/128\u001b[27Gis the sweet spot\". I'll measure the size rath\u001b[74Gr \u001b[77Ghan pick\u001b[86Gone now\u001b[95G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mSample framework:\u001b[23G\u001b[22mthe NVIDIA samp\u001b[39Ge\u001b[42Gdepend on t\u001b[54Geir own \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mnvpro_core2\u001b[39m framework.\u001b[85GThey're\u001b[93Greferences\u001b[104Gto\u001b[107Gread,\u001b[113Gnot\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gdependencies to add.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BOne thing I haven't\u001b[23Gsettled is\u001b[34Gwheth\u001b[40Gr\u001b[42G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mVK_EXT_cluster_acceleration_structure\u001b[39m exists anywhe\u001b[95G: the regist\u001b[108Gy page\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Breturne\u001b[11G 403, th\u001b[20Gugh it\u001b[27Gisn't\u001b[33Gon\u001b[36Gthis\u001b[41Gdriver\u001b[48Geither\u001b[55Gway.\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GBrewed for 2m 7s · done 8:38 pm\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mHow costly is ray traced reflections, and what impact would it have on the engine. Can it be offered as an optional \u001b[39m  \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mextra path for rendering and disabled when needed. I would like it if the impact isn't too strong.\u001b[39m                    \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mIs there a way to have the mega stuff work on AMD hardware, an equivalent API / SDK? If not then it needs to be \u001b[39m      \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255moptional within the renderer.\u001b[39m                                                                                         \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mWhy are we on vulkan 1.3? Are there advantages to moving to 1.4 and will that move break anything in the codebase?\u001b[39m    \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mSample framework - noted. Also research other samples from nvidia, and anything AMD has to offer.\u001b[39m                     \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✶\u001b[3GHarmonizing… \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;136;136;136m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── jettison-0030 ─\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \r\u001b[38C\u001b[3B · esc to interrupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
