kept under test on the gate;\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mevery new feature switches off cleanly\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2.\u001b[6G\u001b[39mRequire\u001b[14GRT+mesh\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRay queries and mesh shaders become required; the old paths are deleted once the new ones are proven, which halves \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mwhat must be kept working\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m3.\u001b[6G\u001b[39mDecide\u001b[13Glater\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mKeep the fallback\u001b[24Guntil player te\u001b[40Gting shows what hardware players have, then decide whether to delete it\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B4. Type something.\r\u001b[1B────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  5.\u001b[6GChat\u001b[11Gabout\u001b[17Gthis\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mEnter to select · Tab/Arrow keys to navigate · Esc to cancel\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;136;136;136m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── jettison-0030 ─\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[14;1H"]
