[0.039, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[5G- Capsaicin is DirectX\u001b[28G12 o\u001b[33Gly. HIP RT\u001b[44Gisn't\u001b[50GVulkan.\u001b[58GThe\u001b[62GDGF\u001b[66GSDK\u001b[70Gtargets\u001b[78Gfuture\u001b[85Ghardware.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G- Useful\u001b[14Gguidance:\u001b[24Gmeshlets\u001b[33Gof\u001b[36G128\u001b[40Gvertices\u001b[49G/\u001b[51G256\u001b[55Gtriangles\u001b[65Gon\u001b[68GRDNA,\u001b[74Ga\u001b[76GTLAS\u001b[81Grebuilt\u001b[89Gevery\u001b[95Gframe,\u001b[102Gand\u001b[106Gopaque,\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B \u001b[7Gf\u001b[9Grst-hit shadow\u001b[24Grays.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mUpshot:\u001b[22m no denoiser\u001b[25Gis available\u001b[38Gunder an acceptable\u001b[58Glicenc\u001b[65G, so the engine writes its own small ones, or\u001b[111Guses\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Beffects that don't need one.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BBlend spaces and blend shapes\u001b[33Gare\u001b[37Gnoted\u001b[43Gfor\u001b[47Gtheir\u001b[53Gown\u001b[57Gsession.\u001b[66GThe\u001b[70Gonly\u001b[75Gtouchpoint\u001b[86Ghere\u001b[91Gis\u001b[94Gthat\u001b[99Gdeforming\u001b[109Gmeshes\u001b[116Gneed\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Btheir accelerati\u001b[20Gn structures refit each\u001b[44Gframe.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mAnswered\u001b[12GClaude's\u001b[21Gquestions:\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  · Devices without ray queries or mesh shaders (pre-Turing NVIDIA, pre-RDNA2 AMD, older Intel): what do they get? → \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mKeep fallback\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m· Lavapipe has no Mega Geometry. How should that path be verified? → Lythir check\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m· How far should ray-traced reflections go in this plan? → Sharp first\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[8G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mShould the engine move to Vulkan 1.4 as step 0 of th\u001b[61Gs plan? → Mov\u001b[75G to 1.4\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mFallback paths are being kept under test, Mega Geometry gets a check script on Lythir,\u001b[90Gand\u001b[94Gsharp\u001b[100Greflections\u001b[112Gcome\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bfirst, with Vulkan 1.4 as step 0. Next I'm checking how AO and the shadow\u001b[77Gcascades\u001b[86Gare\u001b[90Gbuilt,\u001b[97Gsince\u001b[103Gray\u001b[107Gtracing\u001b[115Gwill\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bplug into them.\u001b[19G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m· summary\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m·\u001b[3GHarmonizing… \u001b[42G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mthought for 25s)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
