[0.145, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BVirtual shadow maps are dropped: ray-traced sun shadows replace them, and devices without ray queries keep the\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcascades.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mEffects on the existing roadmap:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mJ27:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m  - Its level-of-detail row closes\u001b[38Gwith\u001b[43GJ37.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G- Its\u001b[11Glocal-light\u001b[23Gshadows\u001b[31Grow\u001b[35Gcloses\u001b[42Gon\u001b[45Gray-tracing\u001b[57Ghardware\u001b[66Gwith\u001b[71GJ44.\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1BJ37\u001b[11Gcan fix \"a model file read\u001b[38Gonce\".\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1BJ46\u001b[11Gdepends on its r\u001b[29G ab\u001b[33Gut glTF mate\u001b[46Gials' ow\u001b[55G factors and \u001b[69Gextures.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mJ12:\u001b[22m becomes cheap once \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mgeometry\u001b[38G\u001b[39mexists.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mJ13:\u001b[22m load-time bu\u001b[23Glds make prefetching worth more,\u001b[56Gand J41\u001b[64Gchang\u001b[70Gs th\u001b[75G model\u001b[82Gcache.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[1m05 and J19:\u001b[19G\u001b[22mooked files go into pack\u001b[44G and\u001b[49Gare\u001b[53Gsigned\u001b[60Gwith\u001b[65Gthem.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[1m20 and the blend-shape session:\u001b[22m t\u001b[40Gey sha\u001b[47Ge J42's compute skin\u001b[68Ging.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[1m24:\u001b[22m its \"transparent surface's tinted sha\u001b[48Gow\" i\u001b[54G th\u001b[58G later\u001b[65Gany-hit\u001b[73Gitem.\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[1m5:\u001b[22m its \"AO at half size\" row is touched by J45.\u001b[55G\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[1m8\u001b[14G\u001b[22mreference frames \u001b[32Gr\u001b[34G re-recorded as each\u001b[55Gpath switches on.\u001b[73G\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[1m01\u001b[10G\u001b[22munaffected.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C