[0.048, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G \u001b[5G- Structs shared with\u001b[27Gthe\u001b[31GGPU\u001b[35Guse\u001b[39Gscalar\u001b[46Glayout\u001b[53Gand\u001b[57Ghave\u001b[62Gstatic\u001b[69Gsize\u001b[74Gchecks.\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1BEvery optional\u001b[22GGPU path logs why it is off, an\u001b[54G has a \u001b[62Gest that it switches off\u001b[87Gcleanly.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mDeclin\u001b[10Gd t\u001b[14G answer\u001b[22GClaude's\u001b[31Gque\u001b[35Gtions:\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  · Does the drafted plan (J36–J49, tracks A and B) stand as the basis to write up? (Write it / Change first)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m· Device-free mesh work in a new CPU module `geometry` (Data tier, beside `resource`)? (New `geometry` / Inside \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m`render`)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mWhat happ\u001b[18Gns to docs/na\u001b[32Gite-research.md? (Fold in / Keep bes\u001b[69Gde)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m· Where do the engine's own dense test meshes (asteroids, a station kit) come from? (Generated / Open assets / \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1BBot\u001b[10G)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mYour answer\u001b[15Gon\u001b[18Gthe\u001b[22Gplan\u001b[27Gwas\u001b[31G\"Write\u001b[38Git\".\u001b[43GThe\u001b[47Gmodule,\u001b[55Gresearch-doc\u001b[68Gand\u001b[72Gtest-content\u001b[85Gquestions\u001b[95Gare\u001b[99Gstill\u001b[105Gopen.\u001b[111GWhat\u001b[116Gwould\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Byou\u001b[7Glike\u001b[12Gto\u001b[15Gclarify\u001b[23Gabout\u001b[29Gthose\u001b[35Gthree?\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GCooked for 9m 10s · done 8:58 pm\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mTalk me through this decision\u001b[39m     