ng (J41) needs a cook step in that tool, or besid\u001b[62G it.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mThe simulation can't see \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mrender\u001b[39m.\u001b[22m Thi\u001b[42G is the architecture's \u001b[66Gard rule: \u001b[38;2;177;185;249msim\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mphysics\u001b[39m,\u001b[90G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mai\u001b[93G\u001b[39mand\u001b[97Gthe\u001b[101Grest\u001b[106Gnever\u001b[112Ginclude\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Git. J12 (a glTF model's collision mesh) is \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mphysics\u001b[39m wanting the same triangles.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m\u001b[1manimation\u001b[39m parses the same glTF file separa\u001b[76G\u001b[22me\u001b[78Gread\u001b[83Gis\u001b[86GJ27's\u001b[92G\"a\u001b[95Gmodel\u001b[101Gfile\u001b[106Gread\u001b[111Gonce\"\u001b[117Grow.\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
