001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mSimulation determinism is J12's question, not this plan's.\u001b[64G\u001b[22mIf\u001b[67G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mphysics\u001b[75G\u001b[39mreads\u001b[81Gcollision\u001b[91Gmeshes\u001b[98Gfrom\u001b[103Git,\u001b[107GJ12\u001b[111Gdecides\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gthen whether the module gets the \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mDETERMINISTIC\u001b[39m flag.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mCost to a game with no dense content:\u001b[22m a small MIT library\u001b[63Gcompiled\u001b[72Gin.\u001b[76GNothing\u001b[84Gruns\u001b[89Gunless\u001b[96Ga\u001b[98Gmodel\u001b[104Gloads.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BDo\u001b[6Gyou\u001b[10Gwant\u001b[15Gthe\u001b[19Gnew\u001b[23G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mgeometry\u001b[32G\u001b[39mmodule,\u001b[40Gor\u001b[43Gone\u001b[47Gof\u001b[50Gthe\u001b[54Gother\u001b[60Goptions?\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GCrunched for 29s · done 8:58 pm\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;136;136;136m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── jettison-0030 ─\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m❯ New geometry module, go with your recommendation We will be using a cook stage in the asset pipeline, so all gltf\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  assets will be cooked into a\u001b[32Gperfo\u001b[38Gmant a\u001b[46G suitable format\u001b[63Gfor consumption by\u001b[82Gthe engine. That may al\u001b[108Gbe gltf if\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bi\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;4H\u001b[?25h"]
