u001b[76GNothing\u001b[84Gruns\u001b[89Gunless\u001b[96Ga\u001b[98Gmodel\u001b[104Gloads.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BDo\u001b[6Gyou\u001b[10Gwant\u001b[15Gthe\u001b[19Gnew\u001b[23G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mgeometry\u001b[32G\u001b[39mmodule,\u001b[40Gor\u001b[43Gone\u001b[47Gof\u001b[50Gthe\u001b[54Gother\u001b[60Goptions?\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GCrunched for 29s · done 8:58 pm\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;136;136;136m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── jettison-0030 ─\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m❯ New geometry module, go with your recommendation We will be using a cook stage in the asset pipeline, so all gltf\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  assets will be cooked into a\u001b[32Gperfo\u001b[38Gmant a\u001b[46G suitable format\u001b[63Gfor consumption by\u001b[82Gthe engine. That may al\u001b[108Gbe gltf if\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bit supports\u001b[15Geverything we need. I a\u001b[39G leaning tow\u001b[52Grds\u001b[56Ghaving\u001b[63Ga sidecar outside the game r\u001b[92Gpo for\u001b[99Gall\u001b[103Gthe game assets\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthat the artists author. A small co\u001b[39Gmand line daemon\u001b[56Gtool would watch\u001b[73Gthat folder\u001b[85Gfor file changes,\u001b[103Gand\u001b[107Gcook\u001b[112Gthe\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bassets into the format the\u001b[30Gengine requires, moving them int\u001b[63G an\u001b[67Gasset\u001b[73Gfolder inside the game repo at that point,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthat mirrors the structur\u001b[30Gof th\u001b[37Gorig\u001b[42Gnal asset fold\u001b[57Gr. This keep\u001b[70G massiv\u001b[78G source ass\u001b[90Gts out of the\u001b[104Ggame\u001b[109Gasse\u001b[114G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Brepo.\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;8H\u001b[?25h"]
