[0.035, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G \u001b[5G- the GLB written by fastgltf's exporter.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bgltfpack stays a refer\u001b[28Gnce, bec\u001b[37Guse a\u001b[43Gsubprocess is harder to test\u001b[72Gand\u001b[76Gto\u001b[79Gkeep\u001b[84Gdeterministic,\u001b[99Gand\u001b[103Git\u001b[106Gdoesn't\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bgenera\u001b[12Ge tangents.\u001b[24G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mThe engine and game split:\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B-\u001b[7GThe\u001b[11Gengine\u001b[18Gowns\u001b[23Gthe\u001b[27Gtool,\u001b[33Gthe\u001b[37Gformat\u001b[44Gand\u001b[48Gthe\u001b[52Gdefaults.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B- Manifest owns its \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mcook.yaml\u001b[39m (source\u001b[43Groot, output root, its defaults)\u001b[76Gand its\u001b[84Gcontent.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B- The cook also rejects\u001b[29Gfile\u001b[34Gnames\u001b[40Gthat\u001b[45Gbreak\u001b[51Gthe\u001b[55Gkebab-case\u001b[66Grule.\u001b[72GThat's\u001b[79Gvalidation\u001b[90Gat\u001b[93Gthe\u001b[97Gboundary\u001b[106Gwhere\u001b[112Gartists'\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G  files come in.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mThe runtime gets leaner.\u001b[22m The m\u001b[36Gshlet buil\u001b[48Gmoves \u001b[55Grom load\u001b[64Gtime\u001b[69G(J38)\u001b[75Ginto\u001b[80Gthe\u001b[84Gcook,\u001b[90Gso\u001b[93Gthe\u001b[97Gengine\u001b[104Gonly\u001b[109Gdecodes.\u001b[118GA\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BGLB w\u001b[11Gthout a meshlet sidecar\u001b[35Gstill draws, on \u001b[52Ghe indexed path, with a\u001b[76Gwarn\u001b[81Gng\u001b[84Gnaming the\u001b[95Gtool.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThe\u001b[7Grepo can't\u001b[18Gsettle\u001b[25Gthe\u001b[29Gremaining\u001b[39Gchoices,\u001b[48Gso\u001b[51Gthese\u001b[57Gare\u001b[61Gfor\u001b[65Gyou:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mAnswered Claude's ques\u001b[26Gions:\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  · What should a cooked model be? → GLB + sidecar\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m· What does the runtime do with a glTF that was not cooked? → Indexed path\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B· Which assets does the cook take? → Models + textures\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m· How is the engine's own test content (source/test/content) cooked? → At build time\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m*\u001b[19G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m2m 32s · ↓\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m10.5k tokens)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[18C\u001b[6B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(shift+tab to cycle) · esc to inte\u001b[54Grupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
