[0.078, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[5Ggenerate tangents.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mThe engine and game split:\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m- The engine owns th\u001b[26G tool\u001b[33Gthe form\u001b[42Gt and th\u001b[51G defaults.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B- Manif\u001b[13Gs\u001b[15G owns its\u001b[25G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mcook.yaml\u001b[35G\u001b[39m(source\u001b[43Groot,\u001b[49Goutput\u001b[56Groot,\u001b[62Gits\u001b[66Gdefaults)\u001b[76Gand\u001b[80Gits\u001b[84Gcontent.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G- The cook also rejects file\u001b[34Gnames\u001b[40Gthat\u001b[45Gbreak\u001b[51Gthe\u001b[55Gkebab-case\u001b[66Grule.\u001b[72GThat's\u001b[79Gvalidation\u001b[90Gat\u001b[93Gthe\u001b[97Gboundary\u001b[106Gwhere\u001b[112Gartists'\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B \u001b[7Gfiles com\u001b[18Gin.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mThe runtime gets leaner.\u001b[22m The me\u001b[37Ghlet build m\u001b[50Gves from load tim\u001b[68G (J38) into\u001b[80Gthe\u001b[86Gok, so\u001b[93Gthe\u001b[97Gengine\u001b[104Gonly\u001b[109Gdecodes.\u001b[118GA\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BGLB with\u001b[14Gut a meshl\u001b[25Gt \u001b[28Gidecar still draws, on\u001b[55Gindexed path, with \u001b[75G warning nami\u001b[89Gg \u001b[92Ghe tool.\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThe repo can't settle the remaining choices,\u001b[48Gs\u001b[50G these are for you:\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mAnswered\u001b[12GClaude's\u001b[21Gquestions:\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  · What should a cooked model be? → GLB + sidecar\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m· What does the runtime do with a glTF that was not cooked? → Indexed path\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m· Which assets does the cook take? → Models + textures\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[8G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mHow i\u001b[14G the engine's own test content\u001b[45G(source/test/content) cooked? → At build time\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mThe cook tool moves to the front of track A as part of J37,\u001b[63Gahead\u001b[69Gof\u001b[72Gthe\u001b[76Gmeshlet\u001b[84Gwork.\u001b[90GTwo\u001b[94Gquestions\u001b[104Gare\u001b[108Gstill\u001b[114Gopen\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bfor you.\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m· summary\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[44C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mthought for 4s)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
