[0.004, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[5G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThe repo can't settle the remaining\u001b[39Gchoices,\u001b[48Gso\u001b[51Gthese\u001b[57Gare\u001b[61Gfor\u001b[65Gyou:\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mAnswered Claude'\u001b[21Gquestions:\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  · What should a cooked model be? → GLB + sidecar\u001b[55G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m· What does the runtime do with a glTF that was not cooked? → Indexed path\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[5G \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m· Which assets does the cook take? → Models + textures\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m· How is the engine's own test content (source/test/content) cooked? → At build time\u001b[91G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[7G\u001b[39mcook\u001b[12Gtool moves to the front of\u001b[39Gtrack A a\u001b[49G part of J37, ahead of\u001b[72Gthe\u001b[76Gmeshlet\u001b[84Gwork.\u001b[90GTwo\u001b[94Gquestions\u001b[104Gare\u001b[108Gstill\u001b[114Gopen\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bfor\u001b[7Gyou.\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · summary\r\u001b[1B────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[1B←\u001b[3G\u001b[48;2;177;185;249m\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m ☐ Research doc \u001b[39m\u001b[49m ☐ Test meshes  ✔ Submit  →\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m\u001b[1mWhat happens to docs/nanite-research.md once the plan document exists?\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m❯\u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m1.\u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mFold in\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mIts analysis that still holds moves into the plan document, the file is deleted and links are updated, so nothing \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mis said twice\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m2.\u001b[6G\u001b[39mKeep\u001b[11Gbeside\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mKept as the dated research record; the plan document links it rather than repeating it\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B3. Type something.\r\u001b[1B────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  4.\u001b[6GChat\u001b[11Gabout\u001b[17Gthis\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mEnter to select · Tab/Arrow keys to navigate · Esc to cancel\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;136;136;136m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── jettison-0030 ─\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[17;1H"]
