[0.004, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  · What should a cooked model be? → GLB + sidecar\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m· What does the runtime do with a glTF that was not cooked? → Indexed path\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[10G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mich assets does the cook\u001b[35Gtake?\u001b[41G→ Models + textures\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1BHow is the engine's own tes\u001b[36G content\u001b[45G(source/tes\u001b[57G/\u001b[60Gnt\u001b[63Gnt) cook\u001b[72Gd? → A\u001b[79G build time\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mThe cook tool moves to the front of track A as part of J37, ahead of the meshlet work. Two\u001b[94Gquestions\u001b[104Gare\u001b[108Gstill\u001b[114Gopen\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bfor\u001b[7Gyou.\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · summary\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mW\u001b[6Gking\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · 12s\u001b[39m…\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m←\u001b[3G ☒ Research doc\u001b[19G\u001b[48;2;177;185;249m\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m ☐ Test meshes \u001b[35G\u001b[39m\u001b[49m✔\u001b[37GSubmit\u001b[45G→\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m\u001b[1mWhere do the engine's dense test meshes (asteroids, a station kit) come from?\r\u001b[2B\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m❯\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m1.\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mGenerated\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mA small generator, run by the build before the cook, makes displaced icospheres and kit pieces; no large binaries \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G  \u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mcommitted, and the bytes are reproducible\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2.\u001b[6G\u001b[39mOpen assets\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mOpenly licensed glTF models (e.g. Khronos samples) fetched at a pinned commit, their licences recorded\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B3\u001b[6G\u001b[39mBoth\u001b[11G\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mG\u001b[8Gner\u001b[12Gted asteroids and kits, plus\u001b[41Gon\u001b[45Gfetched sca\u001b[57Gned model for r\u001b[73Galism\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m4\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[39m5\u001b[27;1H\u001b[15;1H"]
