[0.007, "o", "\u001b[H    - The engine owns the tool, the format and the defaults.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B- Manifest owns its \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mcook.yaml\u001b[39m (source root, output root, its defaults) and its\u001b[84Gcontent.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B- The cook also rejects file names that break the kebab-case\u001b[66Grule.\u001b[72GThat's\u001b[79Gvalidation\u001b[90Gat\u001b[93Gthe\u001b[97Gboundary\u001b[106Gwhere\u001b[112Gartists'\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B files come in.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mThe runtime gets leaner.\u001b[30G\u001b[22mThe\u001b[34Gmeshlet\u001b[42Gbuild\u001b[48Gmoves\u001b[54Gfrom\u001b[59Gload\u001b[64Gtime\u001b[69G(J38)\u001b[75Ginto\u001b[80Gthe\u001b[84Gcook,\u001b[90Gso\u001b[93Gthe\u001b[97Gengine\u001b[104Gonly\u001b[109Gdecodes.\u001b[118GA\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G  GLB with\u001b[14Gut\u001b[17Ga m\u001b[22Ghlet sidecar still draws, on the\u001b[55Gindexed\u001b[63Gpath,\u001b[69Gwith a\u001b[76Gwarning\u001b[84Gnaming the tool.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThe\u001b[7Grepo\u001b[12Gcan't\u001b[18Gsettle\u001b[25Gthe\u001b[29Gremaining\u001b[39Gchoices,\u001b[48Gso\u001b[51Gthese\u001b[57Gare\u001b[61Gfor\u001b[65Gyou:\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mAnswered\u001b[12GClaude's\u001b[21Gquestions:\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  · What should a cooked model be? → GLB + sidecar\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B \u001b[4G \u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m· What does the runtime do with a glTF\u001b[45Gthat was not cooked? → Indexed path\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B· Which assets does the cook take? → Models + textures\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m· How is the engine's own test content (source/test/content) cooked? → At build time\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[39m The cook tool\u001b[17Gm\u001b[19Gves to the front of track A as part of\u001b[58GJ37, ahead of the\u001b[76Gmeshlet\u001b[84Gwork.\u001b[90GTwo\u001b[94Gquestions\u001b[104Gare\u001b[108Gstill\u001b[114Gopen\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bfor you.\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · summary\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m \u001b[3G\u001b[39mWorking\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · 28s\u001b[39m…\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m·\u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;223;134;102mJitterbugging…\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(Ask the last two open questions · 2m 42s · ↓\u001b[64G11.3k tokens)\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;136;136;136m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── jettison-0030 ─\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;136;136;136m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m\u001b[2mOpus 5.5 ctx [##--------] 21% | 5h: 36% | ↑208.2k ↓7\r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;2;255;193;7m⏵⏵ auto mode on\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
