[0.034, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[11Gcook also rejects file names that break th\u001b[54G kebab-case\u001b[66Grule.\u001b[72GThat's\u001b[79Gvalidation\u001b[90Gat\u001b[93Gthe\u001b[97Gboundary\u001b[106Gwhere\u001b[112Gartists'\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B \u001b[7Gfiles come in.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mThe runtime gets leaner.\u001b[22m Th\u001b[34Gmeshle\u001b[41G build moves from load time (J38) into the cook,\u001b[90Gso\u001b[97Gengine only d\u001b[111Gcodes. A\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BGLB without a meshlet\u001b[27Gsidecar\u001b[35Gstill\u001b[41Gdraws,\u001b[48Gon\u001b[51Gthe\u001b[55Gindexed\u001b[63Gpath,\u001b[69Gwith\u001b[74Ga\u001b[76Gwarning\u001b[84Gnaming\u001b[91Gthe\u001b[95Gtool.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThe repo can't settle \u001b[26Ghe r\u001b[31Gm\u001b[33Gining choice\u001b[48Gso\u001b[54Gse are for you:\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mAnswered\u001b[12GClaude's qu\u001b[24Gs\u001b[26Gions:\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  · What should a cooked model be? → GLB + sidecar\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m· What does the runtime do with a glTF that was not cooked? → Indexed path\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[10G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mich assets does the cook\u001b[35Gtake?\u001b[41G→ Models + textures\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1BHow is the engine's own tes\u001b[36G content\u001b[45G(source/tes\u001b[57G/\u001b[60Gnt\u001b[63Gnt) cook\u001b[72Gd? → A\u001b[79G build time\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mThe cook tool moves to the front of track A as part of J37, ahead of the meshlet work. Two\u001b[94Gquestions\u001b[104Gare\u001b[108Gstill\u001b[114Gopen\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bfor\u001b[7Gyou.\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · summary\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mAnswered Claude's questions:\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  · What h