[0.064, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m· What does the runtime do with a glTF that was not cooked? → Indexed path\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m· Which assets does the cook take? → Models + textures\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[8G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mHow i\u001b[14G the engine's own test content\u001b[45G(source/test/content) cooked? → At build time\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mThe cook tool moves to the front of track A as part of J37,\u001b[63Gahead\u001b[69Gof\u001b[72Gthe\u001b[76Gmeshlet\u001b[84Gwork.\u001b[90GTwo\u001b[94Gquestions\u001b[104Gare\u001b[108Gstill\u001b[114Gopen\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bfor you.\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m· summary\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mAnswered\u001b[12GClaude's questions:\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  · What happens to docs/nanite-research.md once the plan document exists? → Fold in\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B· Where do the engine's dense test meshes (asteroids, a station kit) come from? → Generated\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[39m That settles every open question. Before I write, I'm reading scope, decisions, the glossary's\u001b[98Gformat\u001b[105Gand\u001b[109Gevery\u001b[115Glink\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bto\u001b[6Gthe research doc, so the edits follow the existing documents.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mSearched for \u001b[1m7\u001b[22m patterns, read \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file, listed \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m directory, ran \u001b[1m7\u001b[22m shell commands \u001b[83G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mThe\u001b[7Grendering\u001b[17Gbudget\u001b[24Gin\u001b[27Grendering.md\u001b[40Gis\u001b[43G4\u001b[45Gms\u001b[48Gon\u001b[51Ghardware,\u001b[61Gand\u001b[65Gthe\u001b[69Gray-traced\u001b[80Geffects\u001b[88Gcost\u001b[93Gabout\u001b[99Gthat\u001b[104Gmuch\u001b[109Gon\u001b[112Gtheir\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3Gown, so the plan giv\u001b[24Gs them \u001b[32G separate budget a\u001b[51Gd\u001b[53Gleaves \u001b[61Ghe base one unchanged. I'm writing\u001b[96Gthe\u001b[100Gplan\u001b[105Gdocument\u001b[114Gnow.\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m· summary\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[43C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mthought for 9s)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
