[0.200, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mWrite\u001b[22m(docs/dense-geometry-and-ray-tracing.md)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mWrote\u001b[12G\u001b[1m624\u001b[16G\u001b[22mlines\u001b[22Gto\u001b[25G\u001b[1mdocs/dense-geometry-and-ray-tracing.md\r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 1 \u001b[22m# Dens\u001b[16G g\u001b[19Gom\u001b[22Gtry and ray tracing\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m 2 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m3\u001b[9G\u001b[22mThe plan f\u001b[20Gr meshlet\u001b[30Glevels of detail\u001b[47Gdrawn\u001b[53Gby\u001b[56Gmesh\u001b[61Gshaders,\u001b[70Gan\u001b[73Gasset\u001b[79Gcook,\u001b[85Ggeometry\u001b[94Gstreaming\u001b[104Gand\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m4\u001b[9G\u001b[22mray-traced\u001b[20Gshadows,\u001b[29Gambient\u001b[37Gocclusion\u001b[47Gand\u001b[51Greflections,\u001b[64Gwith\u001b[69GRTX\u001b[73GMega\u001b[78GGeometry\u001b[87Gas\u001b[90Gan\u001b[93Goptional\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m5\u001b[9G\u001b[22maccelerator.\u001b[22GAgreed with the user on 2026-11-25; nothing in it is built yet. Its stages are\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m6\u001b[9G\u001b[22m[\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mJ36 to J50\u001b[39m](roadmap.\u001b[31Gd#a-separate-track-dense-geometry-and-ray-tracing) on the roadmap, a track\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m7\u001b[9G\u001b[22ms\u001b[11Gh\u001b[13Gduled apart from Manifest'\u001b[40G queue until the user places\u001b[71G. The se\u001b[80Gtl\u001b[83Gd choices are\u001b[98Glso\u001b[102Gin\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m8\u001b[10G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mdecisions\u001b[39m](decisions.md#rende\u001b[40Ging), each linking back here; the \u001b[75Gesearch this plan re\u001b[96Glaces\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m9\u001b[9G\u001b[22m(t\u001b[13G Nanite study \u001b[28Gf\u001b[30G2026-11-25) is folded into\u001b[57Git.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m… +615 lines \u001b[39m\u001b[K