[0.050, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[5G- the overlaps with the existing roadmap;\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B- the expected issues.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BThe Nanite background is folded into it.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m\u001b[1mroadmap.md\u001b[39m:\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B- A new section, \"A separate track: dense geometry and ray tracing\", with one row per stage: what it is, what\u001b[115Git\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B waits on, and which backlog items it touches.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B- J27's level-of-detail\u001b[29Grow\u001b[33Gmoved\u001b[39Gto\u001b[42GJ37,\u001b[47Gand\u001b[51Gits\u001b[55Gspot\u001b[60Gand\u001b[64Gpoint\u001b[70Gshadows\u001b[78Grow\u001b[82Gnow\u001b[86Gpoints\u001b[93Gto\u001b[96GJ45.\r\u001b[1B    - In \"Waiting on you\", the Nanite line is replaced by one for blend spaces and blend shapes.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m\u001b[1mscope.md\u001b[39m:\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B-\u001b[7GRay\u001b[11Gtracing,\u001b[20Gocclusion\u001b[30Gculling,\u001b[39Ggeometry\u001b[48Gstreaming,\u001b[59Gmeshlets,\u001b[69Gthe\u001b[73Gcook,\u001b[79Gray-traced\u001b[90Gshadows\u001b[98Gand\u001b[102GAO,\u001b[106Gand\u001b[110Gblend\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B    shapes and spaces are now Open.\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B    - The visibility buffer is Deferred, and\u001b[46Gvirtual\u001b[54Gshadow\u001b[61Gmaps\u001b[66Gare\u001b[70GOut.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B- Windows and terrain stay Out.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m\u001b[1mdecisions.md\u001b[39m:\u001b[19G\u001b[22mten\u001b[23Gnew\u001b[27Gdecisions,\u001b[38Geach\u001b[43Glinking\u001b[51Gback\u001b[56Gto\u001b[59Gthe\u001b[63Gplan.\u001b[69GThe\u001b[73G2026-11-11\u001b[84Gdecision\u001b[93Gagainst\u001b[101Gscreen-space\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G  reflections stands: reflections come from\u001b[47Gr\u001b[49Gy tracing, not\u001b[64Gscreen spac\u001b[76G.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m\u001b[1mglossary.md\u001b[39m:\u001b[18G\u001b[22macceleration\u001b[31Gstructure,\u001b[42Gcook\u001b[47G(and\u001b[52Gthe\u001b[56Gcook\u001b[61Gsettings\u001b[70Gfile),\u001b[77Gdepth\u001b[83Gpyramid,\u001b[92Gmeshlet,\u001b[101Gmeshlet\u001b[109Ghierarchy.\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G- \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m\u001b[1mcoding-standards.md\u001b[39m:\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B    - A dependency's licence\u001b[30Gmust\u001b[35Gallow\u001b[41Gopen-source\u001b[53Gdistribution.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B-\u001b[7GFacts\u001b[13Gabout\u001b[19GAPIs,\u001b[25Gdrivers\u001b[33Gand\u001b[37Gdevices\u001b[45Gare\u001b[49Gchecked\u001b[57Gagainst\u001b[65Gprimary\u001b[73Gsources\u001b[81Gand\u001b[85Gdated.\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G  -\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
