[0.125, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 550 \u001b[22m   the KHR builder the same cut as triangles; `scripts/mega-geometry-check.sh`, which draws the\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 551 \u001b[22m   benchmark scene on the 5060 Ti offscreen with each builder and compares the frames.\u001b[K\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m2\u001b[12G\u001b[22m-\u001b[14G**Exit criterion.** With the same\u001b[48Gcut,\u001b[53Gthe\u001b[57Gtwo\u001b[61Gbuilders'\u001b[71Gframes\u001b[78Gagree\u001b[84Gwithin\u001b[91Gthe\u001b[95Greference\u001b[105Gviews'\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(docs/dense-g\u001b[23Gometry-and-r\u001b[36Gy-tracing.md)\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdded\u001b[12G\u001b[1m2\u001b[14G\u001b[22mlines,\u001b[21Gremoved\u001b[29G\u001b[1m1\u001b[31G\u001b[22mline\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[2m 551 \u001b[22m   benchmark\u001b[24Gscene\u001b[30Gon\u001b[33Gthe\u001b[37G5060\u001b[42GTi\u001b[45Goffscreen\u001b[55Gwith\u001b[60Geach\u001b[65Gbuilder\u001b[73Gand\u001b[77Gcompares\u001b[86Gthe\u001b[90Gframes.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 552 \u001b[12G\u001b[22m-\u001b[14G**Exit\u001b[21Gcriterion.**\u001b[34GWith\u001b[39Gthe\u001b[43Gsame\u001b[48Gcut,\u001b[53Gthe\u001b[57Gtwo\u001b[61Gbuilders'\u001b[71Gframes\u001b[78Gagree\u001b[84Gwithin\u001b[91Gthe\u001b[95Greference\u001b[105Gviews'\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 553 \u001b[22m   fuzz; \u001b[21G view\u001b[27Gof\u001b[30Ga\u001b[32Gdense\u001b[38Gsilhouette\u001b[49Gunder\u001b[55Ga\u001b[57Glow\u001b[61Gsun\u001b[65Gshows\u001b[71Gneither\u001b[79Gacne\u001b[84Gnor\u001b[88Ga\u001b[90Gleak\u001b[95Gat\u001b[98Gthe\u001b[102Graster's\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 554 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  level of detail; build times and memory recorded. The gate is unaffected:                           \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0