[0.444, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 602 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m1. A model's ray-tracing level drops to a coarser cooked level, the largest models first.             \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 603 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m2. Instances leave the TLAS, the farthest first: they draw, but cast no ray-traced shadow and         \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 604 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   show in no reflection.                                                                             \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 605 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m3. The coarsest pages are never dropped, since every model must draw. If they alone pass the          \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 606 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   budget, it is exceeded, and an error names the scene's total; the dev tools show it.               \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 607 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m                                                                                                      \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 608 \u001b[22m ## How it is tested\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m609\u001b[12G\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m6\u001b[9G0\u001b[12G\u001b[22m-\u001b[14G**Suites.** `geometry`:\u001b[38Glevels and their \u001b[57Grors, the h\u001b[69Gerarchy's cuts, the\u001b[89Gformats' round trips,\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(docs/dense-geometry-and-ray-tracing.md)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdde\u001b[11G \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m line, rem\u001b[24Gv\u001b[26Gd \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m line\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m 410 \u001b[12G\u001b[22m|\u001b[14GJ45 |\u001b[20GRay-traced local\u001b[37Gshadows\u001b[45G|\u001b[47GJ44\u001b[51G|\u001b[53G1\u001b[55Gweek\u001b[60G|\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m11\u