[0.222, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdded \u001b[1m8\u001b[22m lines, removed \u001b[1m4\u001b[22m lines\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 321 \u001b[22m   for a frame is read back and compared with a CPU reference built on the same GLSL compiled as C++.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 322 \u001b[22m - **Occlusion** is two-pass: draw what was visible last frame, build a depth pyramid with a min\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 323 \u001b[22m   reduction, test the rest against it and draw what passes. The horizon test stays, for bodies.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 324 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m- **Streaming.** The GPU writes the groups it wanted and lacked to a feedback buffer, read a frame in \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m 325 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  flight later. The I/O worker reads those pages, decodes them and uploads through a staging ring     \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m 326 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  into a pool of fixed-size pages; the least recently used are evicted. The coarsest levels are       \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m 327 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  always loaded, so every model always draws something.                                               \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 324 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m- **Streaming.** Traversal stops at resident nodes, so a cut whose pages are missing draws their      \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 325 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  resident parents instead. The GPU writes the groups it wanted and lacked to a feedback buffer,      \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 326 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  read a frame in flight later, and stamps each page it used with the frame. The I/O worker reads     \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 327 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  the wanted pages, decodes them and uploads through a staging ring into a pool of fixed-size pages;  \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 328 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  the least recently used are evicted. Demand comes from every cut: the raster's, and with            \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 329 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mJ48\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](roadmap.md#j48) the rays' as well, so geometry seen only in a reflection or a shadow is       \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 330 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  requested and kept like anything on screen. The coarsest levels are always loaded, so every model   \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 331 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  always draws something.                                                                             \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 332 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 333 \u001b[22m ### Ray tracing\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 334 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B     \u001b[14G \u001b[16G        \u001b[25G  \u001b[28G   \u001b[32G       \u001b[40G    \u001b[45G  \u001b[77G\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[0.366, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mMade \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m scratchpad edit \u001b[38;2;56;166;96m+20\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m, read \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file, ran \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m shell commands, recalled \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m memory, wrote \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m memories \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mRound 2 is\u001b[14Grunning on \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mgpt-6.1-sol\u001b[39m at high effort. Windows is now\u001b[68GDeferred \u001b[78Gn scop\u001b[85G, to be built near\u001b[104Gthe\u001b[108Gend\u001b[112Gof\u001b[115Gthis\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bphase, and\u001b[14Gthat's also in decisions\u001b[40Gnd memory. Waiting\u001b[59Gfor round 2's v\u001b[75Grdict.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;107;128m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mBackground command \"Cross-review round 2 with gpt-6.1-sol on high\" failed with exit code 1\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mSearched for \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m pattern, read \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m files, ran \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(docs/dense-geometry-and-ray-tracing.md)\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdded \u001b[1m8\u001b[22m lines, removed \u001b[1m4\u001b[22m lines\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 321 \u001b[22m   for a frame is read back and compared with a CPU reference built on the same GLSL compiled as C++.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 322 \u001b[22m - **Occlusion** is two-pass: draw what was visible last frame, build a depth pyramid with a min\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 323 \u001b[22m   reduction, test the rest against it and draw what passes. The horizon test stays, for bodies.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 324 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m- **Streaming.** The GPU writes the groups it wanted and lacked to a feedback buffer, read a frame in \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m 325 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  flight later. The I/O worker reads those pages, decodes them and uploads through a staging ring     \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m 326 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  into a pool of fixed-size pages; the least recently used are evicted. The coarsest levels are       \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m 327 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  always loaded, so every model always draws something.                                               \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 324 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m- **Streaming.** Traversal stops at resident nodes, so a cut whose pages are missing draws their      \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 325 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  resident parents instead. The GPU\u001b[76Gand lacked to a feedback buffer,      \u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
