[0.905, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m     \u001b[22m the device table, so a\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m 374 \u001b[12G\u001b[22m \u001b[14Gfuture\u001b[21G`EXT` or `KHR`\u001b[36Gcluster\u001b[44Gextension\u001b[54Gis\u001b[57Ga\u001b[59Glocal\u001b[65Gchange.\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m75\u001b[14G\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(docs/dense-ge\u001b[24Gmetry-and-ray-tracing.md)\u001b[50G\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdded \u001b[1m4\u001b[22m lines, removed \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m line\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 236 \u001b[22m   `clusterlod.h`; attributes quantised. The cooked GLB keeps the nodes, skins, clips and extras the\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 237 \u001b[22m   rig and docks read, and is written by fastgltf.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 238 \u001b[22m - **Textures.** The images a model's materials name, and loose images, become KTX 2 with the import\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 239 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  script's settings (UASTC for colour and normal maps), through libktx's encoder.                     \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 239 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  script's settings (UASTC for colour and normal maps), through libktx's encoder.\u001b[48;2;4;71;0m A cooked GLB\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m        \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 240 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  names them through `KHR_texture_basisu`, with no PNG fallback, so the reader enables that           \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 241 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  extension too, the model loader takes the extension's image index, and the material cache decodes   \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 242 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  KTX 2 through `Texture`'s existing reader instead of `DecodeImage` (stb_image).                     \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 243 \u001b[22m - **Formats.** No version numbers or migrations\u001b[60Guntil\u001b[66Gplayer\u001b[73Gtesting\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m 244 \u001b[12G\u001b[22m \u001b[14G([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mformats in place\u001b[39m](decisions.md#persistence)):\u001b[62Ga\u001b[64Gformat\u001b[71Gchange\u001b[78Gcooks\u001b[84Geverything\u001b[95Gagain.\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m45\u001b[12G\u001b[22m-\u001b[14G**The \u001b[21Gngine's own content** (`source/test/c\u001b[59Gntent`)\u001b[67Gis cooked\u001b[77Gby CMake \u001b[88Gto\u001b[91Gthe buil\u001b[101Gtree, as\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(docs/dense-g\u001b[23Gometry-and-ray-tracing.md)\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdded \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m lines, removed \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m line            \u001b[76G\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
