[0.002, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 239 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  script's settings (UASTC for colour and normal maps), through libktx's encoder.\u001b[48;2;4;71;0m A cooked GLB\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m        \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 240 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  names them through `KHR_texture_basisu`, with no PNG fallback, so the reader enables that           \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 241 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  extension too, the model loader takes the extension's image index, and the material cache decodes   \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 242 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  KTX 2 through `Texture`'s existing reader instead of `DecodeImage` (stb_image).                     \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 243 \u001b[22m - **Formats.** No version numbers or migrations\u001b[60Guntil\u001b[66Gplayer\u001b[73Gtesting\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m 244 \u001b[12G\u001b[22m \u001b[14G([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mformats in place\u001b[39m](decisions.md#persistence)):\u001b[62Ga\u001b[64Gformat\u001b[71Gchange\u001b[78Gcooks\u001b[84Geverything\u001b[95Gagain.\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m45\u001b[12G\u001b[22m-\u001b[14G**The \u001b[21Gngine's own content** (`source/test/c\u001b[59Gntent`)\u001b[67Gis cooked\u001b[77Gby CMake \u001b[88Gto\u001b[91Gthe buil\u001b[101Gtree, as\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(docs/dense-g\u001b[23Gometry-and-ray-tracing.md)\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdded \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m lines, removed \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m line\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 255 \u001b[22m - **The model, `<name>.glb`.** Plain glTF 2.0 with `KHR_mesh_quantization` and\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 256 \u001b[22m   `KHR_meshopt_compression`, which fastgltf 1.0.1 parses and meshoptimizer decodes. Its levels of\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 257 \u001b[22m   detail are its primitives in order, finest first, with their errors in the primitive's extras;\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 258 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  `asset.extras` carries the cook key. `geometry`'s reader opens it with \u001b[48;2;92;2;0mboth\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m \u001b[48;2;92;2;0mextensions enabled \u001b[48;2;61;1;0mand  \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 258 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  `asset.extras` carries the cook key. `geometry`'s reader opens it with \u001b[48;2;4;71;0mthese\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m and\u001b[48;2;4;71;0m `KHR_texture_basisu\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m\u001b[48;2;4;71;0m`\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m                                                                                                     \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 259 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  enabled and                                                                                         \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 260 \u001b[14G\u001b[22mdecodes\u001b[22Gthe\u001b[26Gcompressed\u001b[37Gbuffer\u001b[44Gviews,\u001b[51Gand\u001b[55Gthe\u001b[59Gmodel\u001b[65Gloader\u001b[72Gand\u001b[76Gthe\u001b[80Grig\u001b[84Gloader\u001b[91Gboth\u001b[96Ggo\u001b[99Gthrough\u001b[107Git\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 261 \u001b[22m   (today each sets up its own parser,\u001b[50Gwith\u001b[55Gno\u001b[58Gextensions,\u001b[70Gand\u001b[74Gwould\u001b[80Grefuse\u001b[87Gthe\u001b[91Gfile).\u001b[98GA\u001b[100GGLB\u001b[104Gwith\u001b[109Gno\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m 262 \u001b[12G\u001b[22m \u001b[14Gmeshlet file beside it\u001b[37Gdraws\u001b[43Gon\u001b[46Gt\u001b[76Ged\u001b[79GglTF\u001b[84Gkeeps\u001b[90Gworking,\u001b[99Gwith\u001b[104Ga\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
