[0.001, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdded \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m lines, removed \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m line\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 510 \u001b[22m - **Exit criterion.** With a pool smaller than the scene, a camera flight on lavapipe ends on the\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 511 \u001b[22m   same frame as with the scene fully loaded; no frame draws a model with nothing; the pool's\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 512 \u001b[22m   residency shown in the dev tools; a generated scene with several times the budget's geometry\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 513 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  stays within it, each share reported.                                                               \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 513 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  stays within it, each share reported; a scene whose fixed share passes the budget follows the       \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 514 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116moverflow order\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](#memory), each step logged.                                                        \r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[2m5\u001b[12G\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 516 \u001b[12G\u001b[22m###\u001b[16GJ44.\u001b[21GRay-traced\u001b[32Gsun\u001b[36Gshadows\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 517 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(docs/dense-geom\u001b[26Gtry-and-ray-tracing.md)\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdded\u001b[12G\u001b[1m10\u001b[22m lines\u001b[K\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m95\u001b[12G\u001b[22mthe TLAS and build scratch. `GetFrameStats` an\u001b[60Gth\u001b[63G dev \u001b[69Gools repor\u001b[80G each share. I\u001b[95Gs defaul\u001b[104G is\u001b[108Gset\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 596 \u001b[22m by measurement in J43; lavapipe runs with a small one, so the gate exercises eviction.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 597 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m98\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mPart of it cannot be evicted: each model's coarsest pages, its ray-tracing level and that level's     \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 599 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mbottom-level structure. When that fixed share would pass the budget, the engine gives way in this     \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 600 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242morder, logging each step with the model's name:                                                       \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 601 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m                                   \u001b[75G                                       \u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
