[0.185, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(docs/dense-geom\u001b[26Gtry-and-ray-tracing.md)\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdded\u001b[12G\u001b[1m10\u001b[22m lines\u001b[K\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m95\u001b[12G\u001b[22mthe TLAS and build scratch. `GetFrameStats` an\u001b[60Gth\u001b[63G dev \u001b[69Gools repor\u001b[80G each share. I\u001b[95Gs defaul\u001b[104G is\u001b[108Gset\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 596 \u001b[22m by measurement in J43; lavapipe runs with a small one, so the gate exercises eviction.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 597 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m98\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mPart of it cannot be evicted: each model's coarsest pages, its ray-tracing level and that level's     \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 599 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mbottom-level structure. When that fixed share would pass the budget, the engine gives way in this     \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 600 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242morder, logging each step with the model's name:                                                       \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 601 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m                                                                                                      \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 602 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m1. A model's ray-tracing level drops to a coarser cooked level, the largest models first.             \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 603 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m2. Instances leave the TLAS, the farthest first: they draw, but cast no ray-traced shadow and         \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 604 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   show in no reflection.                                                                             \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 605 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m3. The coarsest pages are never dropped, since every model must draw. If they alone pass the          \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 606 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   budget, it is exceeded, and an error names the scene's total; the dev tools show it.               \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 607 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m                                                                                                      \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 608 \u001b[22m ## How it is tested\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 609 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 610 \u001b[22m - **Suites.** `geometry`: levels and their errors, the hierarchy's cuts, the formats' round trips,\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B                                         \u001b[75G\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
