Gand\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gcarries the same cook key. Otherwise the\u001b[47Gode\u001b[51G is drawn without meshlets, \u001b[80Go a\u001b[84Gmod'\u001b[89G unco\u001b[95Gked\u001b[99Gmodel can't pick up\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bthe ba\u001b[12Ge game's meshlet data.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mStage dependencies:\u001b[22m J42\u001b[29Gbuilds\u001b[36Gits\u001b[40Gray-tracing\u001b[52Gstructures\u001b[63Gfrom\u001b[68GJ37's\u001b[74Glevels\u001b[81Gof\u001b[84Gdetail,\u001b[92Gso\u001b[95Git\u001b[98Gno\u001b[101Glonger\u001b[108Gneeds\u001b[114Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gmeshlet hierarchy. J48 now needs J43.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mMega Geometry (J48):\u001b[22m a\u001b[29Ge\u001b[32Gpass picks\u001b[43Gthe\u001b[47Gdetail\u001b[54Glevel\u001b[60Gbefore\u001b[67Gthe\u001b[71Gray-tracing\u001b[83Gstructures\u001b[94Gare\u001b[98Gbuilt.\u001b[105GIt\u001b[108Gselects\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Ggeometry separately for drawing\u001b[37Gand for rays, so\u001b[54Gobj\u001b[58Gcts off scr\u001b[70Gen still cast shadows. Both\u001b[98Gselections ask \u001b[114Ghe\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bstreamer\u001b[14Gfor missing data, and J48's test now\u001b[51Gc\u001b[53Gmpar\u001b[58Gs the two builders on the\u001b[85Game geometry.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mMemory:\u001b[22m one budget covers all geometry mem\u001b[77Ghold, ther\u001b[89Gis a fixed\u001b[100Gorder\u001b[106Gfor\u001b[110Ggiving\u001b[117Gway:\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
