[0.061, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mThe\u001b[7Gcross-review\u001b[20Gran\u001b[24Gall\u001b[28Gthree\u001b[34Grounds\u001b[41Gon\u001b[44G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mgpt-6.1-sol\u001b[56G\u001b[39mat\u001b[59Ghigh\u001b[64Geffort,\u001b[72Gand\u001b[76Gthe\u001b[80Greviewer\u001b[89Gnever\u001b[95Gapproved.\u001b[105GRounds\u001b[112G1\u001b[114Gand\u001b[118G2\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3Graised 13 problems, and I acc\u001b[33Gpted and fixed all of them. Round 3 left one pa\u001b[81Gtly open, which I have since fixed, but\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bno round has ch\u001b[19Gcked that\u001b[29Gfix.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat the review changed in the plan:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m- \u001b[1mReflections:\u001b[22m reflection rays now find\u001b[43Gthe\u001b[47Gclosest\u001b[55Gsurface.\u001b[64GOnly\u001b[69Gshadow\u001b[76Gand\u001b[80Gocclusion\u001b[90Grays\u001b[95Gstop\u001b[100Gat\u001b[103Gthe\u001b[107Gfirst\u001b[113Ghit.\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mading cooked files:\u001b[22m a\u001b[29Gshared reader\u001b[43Gin \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mgeometry\u001b[55G\u001b[39mopens the cooked m\u001b[74Gdel files with the extensions they need. The\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gmodel loader and the rig loader both use\u001b[46Git, and textures load as KTX 2 through the\u001b[89Gexisting \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mTexture\u001b[39m read\u001b[111Gr. As\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bfirst\u001b[11Gwritten, today's loaders would\u001b[42Ghave refused the cooked files; the\u001b[77Greviewer d\u001b[88Gmonstrated this with a test\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bprogram.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mWhen the cook re-runs:\u001b[28G\u001b[22mthe\u001b[32Gcook's\u001b[39Gcache\u001b[45Gkey\u001b[49Gnow\u001b[53Gcovers\u001b[60Gevery\u001b[66Gfile\u001b[71Ga\u001b[73Gmodel\u001b[79Greferences\u001b[90Gand\u001b[94Gevery\u001b[100Gsettings\u001b[109Glayer.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5GEditing only