the\u001b[71Gray-tracing\u001b[83Gstructures\u001b[94Gare\u001b[98Gbuilt.\u001b[105GIt\u001b[108Gselects\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Ggeometry separately for drawing\u001b[37Gand for rays, so\u001b[54Gobj\u001b[58Gcts off scr\u001b[70Gen still cast shadows. Both\u001b[98Gselections ask \u001b[114Ghe\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bstreamer\u001b[14Gfor missing data, and J48's test now\u001b[51Gc\u001b[53Gmpar\u001b[58Gs the two builders on the\u001b[85Game geometry.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mMemory:\u001b[22m one budget covers all geometry memory\u001b[51Gon the GPU. When\u001b[68Git can't\u001b[77Ghold, ther\u001b[89Gis a fixed\u001b[100Gorder\u001b[106Gfor\u001b[110Ggiving\u001b[117Gway:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gray-traci\u001b[15Gg\u001b[17Gdetail\u001b[24Gis reduced\u001b[35Gfirst, then dista\u001b[53Gt instances are dropped\u001b[77Gfrom ray tracing, and the coarsest levels\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Balways stay\u001b[17Gloaded. The fallback path without meshlets is covere\u001b[70G too.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mDenoiser:\u001b[22m I\u001b[17Gwas wrong that none had a\u001b[43Gl\u001b[45Gcence\u001b[51Gw\u001b[53G could\u001b[60Gu\u001b[62Ge. Fid\u001b[69Gli\u001b[72GyFX\u001b[76Gv1.1.4\u001b[83Ghas\u001b[87GMIT-licensed\u001b[100Gshadow\u001b[107Gand\u001b[111Greflection\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gdenoisers\u001b[15Gin GLSL, so\u001b[29Gey\u001b[32Gare now the first candidate\u001b[60Gfor J49. We'd write our own only wher\u001b[98G they don't fit.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWindows:\u001b[12G\u001b[22min\u001b[15Gscope\u001b[21Git\u001b[24Gmoves\u001b[30Gfrom\u001b[35GOut\u001b[39Gto\u001b[42GDefer\u001b[75Gd\u001b[77Gof\u001b[80Gthis\u001b[85Gphase.\u001b[92GThere\u001b[98Gis\u001b[101Ga\u001b[103Gnew\u001b[107Gdecision\u001b[116Gunder\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
