[0.195, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bprogram.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mWhen the cook re-runs:\u001b[28G\u001b[22mthe\u001b[32Gcook's\u001b[39Gcache\u001b[45Gkey\u001b[49Gnow\u001b[53Gcovers\u001b[60Gevery\u001b[66Gfile\u001b[71Ga\u001b[73Gmodel\u001b[79Greferences\u001b[90Gand\u001b[94Gevery\u001b[100Gsettings\u001b[109Glayer.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5GEditing only a model's\u001b[28Gbuffer file re-cooks\u001b[49Git.\u001b[53G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mMesh file and meshlet file must match:\u001b[22m a meshlet\u001b[54Gfile\u001b[59Gis\u001b[62Gused\u001b[67Gonly\u001b[72Gif\u001b[75Git\u001b[78Gis\u001b[81Gin\u001b[84Gthe\u001b[88Gsame\u001b[93Gmount\u001b[99Gas\u001b[102Gits\u001b[106Gmodel\u001b[112Gfile\u001b[117Gand\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gcarries the same cook key. Otherwise the\u001b[47Gode\u001b[51G is drawn without meshlets, \u001b[80Go a\u001b[84Gmod'\u001b[89G unco\u001b[95Gked\u001b[99Gmodel can't pick up\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bthe ba\u001b[12Ge game's meshlet data.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mStage dependencies:\u001b[22m J42\u001b[29Gbuilds\u001b[36Gits\u001b[40Gray-tracing\u001b[52Gstructures\u001b[63Gfrom\u001b[68GJ37's\u001b[74Glevels\u001b[81Gof\u001b[84Gdetail,\u001b[92Gso\u001b[95Git\u001b[98Gno\u001b[101Glonger\u001b[108Gneeds\u001b[114Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gmeshlet hierarchy. J48 now needs J43.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mMega Geometry (J48):\u001b[22m a\u001b[29Ge\u001b[32Gpass picks\u001b[43Gthe\u001b[47Gdetail\u001b[54Glevel\u001b[60Gbefore\u001b[67Gthe\u001b[71Gray-tracing\u001b[83Gstructures\u001b[94Gare\u001b[98Gbuilt.\u001b[105GIt\u001b[108Gselects\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Ggeometry separately for drawing\u001b[37Gand for rays, so\u001b[54Gobj\u001b[58Gcts off scr\u001b[70Gen still cast shadows. Both\u001b[98Gselections ask \u001b[114Ghe\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bstreamer\u001b[14Gfor missing data, and J48's test now\u001b[51Gc\u001b[53Gmpar\u001b[58Gs the two builders on the\u001b[85Game geometry.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mMemory:\u001b[22m one budget covers all geometry memory\u001b[51Gon the GPU. When\u001b[68Git can't\u001b[77Ghold, ther\u001b[89Gis a fixed\u001b[100Gorder\u001b[106Gfor\u001b[110Ggiving\u001b[117Gway:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gray-traci\u001b[15Gg\u001b[17Gdetail\u001b[24Gis reduced\u001b[35Gfirst, then dista\u001b[53Gt instances are dropped\u001b[77Gfrom ray tracing, and the coarsest levels\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Balways stay\u001b[17Gloaded. The fallback path without meshlets is covere\u001b[70G too.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mDenoiser:\u001b[22m I\u001b[17Gwas wrong that none had a\u001b[43Gl\u001b[45Gcence\u001b[51Gw\u001b[53G could\u001b[60Gu\u001b[62Ge. Fid\u001b[69Gli\u001b[72GyFX\u001b[76Gv1.1.4\u001b[83Ghas\u001b[87GMIT-licensed\u001b[100Gshadow\u001b[107Gand\u001b[111Greflection\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gdenoisers\u001b[15Gin GLSL, so\u001b[29Gey\u001b[32Gare now the first candidate\u001b[60Gfor J49. We'd write our own only wher\u001b[98G they don't fit.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWindows:\u001b[12G\u001b[22min\u001b[15Gscope\u001b[21Git\u001b[24Gmoves\u001b[30Gfrom\u001b[35GOut\u001b[39Gto\u001b[42GDeferred,\u001b[52Gto\u001b[55Gbe\u001b[58Gbuilt\u001b[64Gnear\u001b[69Gthe\u001b[73Gend\u001b[77Gof\u001b[80Gthis\u001b[85Gphase.\u001b[92GThere\u001b[98Gis\u001b[101Ga\u001b[103Gnew\u001b[107Gdecision\u001b[116Gunder\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BBuild and platform: design\u001b[31Gor Linux until th\u001b[49Gn\u001b[52Gkeep platform code behind \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mplatform\u001b[39m, and\u001b[92Gc\u001b[94Goose only dependencies\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthat also\u001b[13Gbuild on Windows. It's in memory\u001b[75G planning reviews use Sol 6.1 on high.\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
