[0.045, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m*\"Inspect ou\u001b[16G glTF loader and Vulkan mesh/shader pipeline. I want to add support for glTF morph targets (blend \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bshapes)\u001b[11Gauthored in Blender.\u001b[39m                                              \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mUpdate the glTF loader to\u001b[29Gparse primitive.targ\u001b[50Gts (POSITION and NORMAL \u001b[75Geltas), default mesh.weights, and \u001b[39m     \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mmesh.extras[\"targetNam\u001b[26Gs\"].\u001b[39m \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mPack the morph deltas into \u001b[31G Vulkan S\u001b[41Gorage Buffer (S\u001b[57GBO) per mesh.\u001b[39m                                       \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mUpdat\u001b[9G our skinned vertex shader to read a weights array from a UBO/SSBO and apply active morph target deltas to the \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bvertex position and normal\u001b[30GBEFORE applyin\u001b[45G skeletal skinning matrices.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BExpos\u001b[10Gthe\u001b[14Gwe\u001b[17Gghts\u001b[22Gon \u001b[26Ghe\u001b[29Gmesh compon\u001b[41Gnt\u001b[44Gso I can test them with sliders.\"*\u001b[39m                                          \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mIf you'd l\u001b[14Gke to keep bui\u001b[29Gding this out, let me know:\u001b[39m                 \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mWhich glTF\u001b[14Glibrary\u001b[22Gyour cod\u001b[31Gbase uses (fa\u001b[45Gtgltf, tinygl\u001b[59Gf, or cgltf)\u001b[39m       \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mWhether you want\u001b[20Ga Claude Code\u001b[34Gprompt for the 2D blend space next\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m                                                                    \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mSearched for \u001b[1m9\u001b[22m patterns, read \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m files, listed \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m directories, ran \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m shell commands · \u001b[38;2;255;107;128m1 failed\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mDon't trust gemini, do your own research, same rules as just before about using our codebase as ground truth.\u001b[39m         \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mSearching\u001b[13Gfor\u001b[17G\u001b[1m2\u001b[19G\u001b[22mpatterns,\u001b[29Greading\u001b[37G\u001b[1m1\u001b[39G\u001b[22mfile,\u001b[45Grunning\u001b[53G\u001b[1m1\u001b[55G\u001b[22mshell\u001b[61Gcommand…\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  ~/.claude/projects/-home-ivan-projects-jettison/68ff7221-b99f-45d9-816f-59880fff26d3/tool-results/b3wv7xno5.txt\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[5B\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
