[0.005, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mSearched for \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m patterns, ran \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[39m I checked the Gemini notes: the morph-before-skin order, the Blender name convention and the shape-key export\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bbehaviour\u001b[13Ghold,\u001b[19Gbut\u001b[23Gthe\u001b[27Geffort\u001b[34Gestimate,\u001b[44Gthe\u001b[48GNLA\u001b[52Gmode,\u001b[58Gthe\u001b[62Gslerp\u001b[68Gblending,\u001b[78Gthe\u001b[82Gnormalised-time\u001b[98Gsync\u001b[103Gand\u001b[107Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bvertex-shader approach don't fit our code. Next I'll go through the interview.\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · summary\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[1B← \u001b[48;2;177;185;249m\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m ☐ Consumer \u001b[39m\u001b[49m ☐ Face drivers  ☐ Root motion  ☐ Combining  ✔ Submit  →\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[2m│\u001b[3G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m\u001b[1mWho needs blend shapes and blend spaces first? The engine's rule is an acceptance test in an independent engine \r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m│\u001b[3G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m\u001b[1mconsumer and in Manifest, and today no consumer has characters.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m❯\u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m1.\u001b[39m [ ] \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mManifest\u001b[19G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[9C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mCharacters in Manifest: crew, station people, pilots in cockpits. Tell me what they do.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2.\u001b[39m [ ] A future game\u001b[K\r\u001b[9C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mA later game with characters on foot; the engine gets ready now.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m3.\u001b[39m [ ] Mechanical morphs\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B       \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mThe art team's non-character uses: hull damage, inflating or folding parts, panels.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m4.\u001b[39m [ ] Engine\u001b[17Gtest content\u001b[K\r\u001b[9C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mOnly the engine's own test content and samples for now.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m5. \u001b[39m[ ] \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mType something\u001b[25G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mNext\r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  6.\u001b[6GChat\u001b[11Gabout\u001b[17Gthis\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mEnter to select · Tab/Arrow keys to navigate · Esc to cancel\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;136;136;136m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── jettison-0030 ─\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[13;1H"]
