[0.006, "o", "\u001b[H\r\u001b[30C\u001b[7B ☒ Root motion \u001b[48;2;177;185;249m\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m ☐ Combining \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m\u001b[1mHow are clips,\u001b[16Gbl\u001b[19Gnd spaces\u001b[29Ga\u001b[31Gd faces combined on one char\u001b[60Gcter?\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mCom\u001b[10Gonents (Recommen\u001b[27Ged)\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mA few players:\u001b[21Ga blend-space player, a cross-fade between players (J20's open\u001b[84Grow), \u001b[91Gnd\u001b[94Glayers by\u001b[104Gjoint mask\u001b[115G(face \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bov\u001b[9Gr body). The gam\u001b[26G's cod\u001b[33G picks wha\u001b[44G plays.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1BSta\u001b[10Ge machine\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mData-dri\u001b[16Gn states \u001b[26Gnd trans\u001b[35Gtions in YAML,\u001b[50Gwith cond\u001b[60Gtions on parameters the game se\u001b[92Gs.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m3.\u001b[6G\u001b[39mAnimation graph\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mA node graph of blends, layers and states, like an Unreal animation blueprint. Big, and it wants an editor.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B4. \u001b[7Gype s\u001b[13Gmething.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m5. Chat about this\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mEnter to select · Tab/Arrow keys to navigate · Esc to cancel\r\u001b[2B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[12;1H"]
