[0.005, "o", "\u001b[H\r\u001b[18C\u001b[8B ☒ Lip sync \u001b[48;2;177;185;249m\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m ☐ Blend spaces \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m\u001b[1mWhich blend s\u001b[15Gaces,\u001b[21Gand how are gaits kept in step?\r\u001b[5C\u001b[2B\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m1D+2D, mark\u001b[18Grs (Rec.)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m1D (speed) \u001b[18Gnd 2D\u001b[24G(veloc\u001b[31Gty on the ground plane). Clips stay in\u001b[70Gstep on na\u001b[81Ged sync mark\u001b[94Grs (left foot, righ\u001b[114G foot),\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bwhich\u001b[12GglTF cl\u001b[20Gps first n\u001b[31Ged events for:\u001b[46GJ20's open row.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B1D+2D, normalised\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mBoth kinds, kept in ste\u001b[30G b\u001b[33G \u001b[35Gormalised\u001b[45Gtime alone. Simpler, b\u001b[68Gt needs every\u001b[82Gclip to have th\u001b[98G same\u001b[104Gstep count and to\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  \u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mstart on the same foot, which the cook can check.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B3.\u001b[6G\u001b[39m1D only\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mSpeed alone: idle, walk, run. No strafing. 2D later, if asked for.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B4. Type so\u001b[15Gthing.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  5. Chat about this\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mEnter to select · Tab/Arrow keys to navigate · Esc to cancel\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[13;1H"]
