[3.251, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b[8G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mWhich blend s\u001b[22Gaces,\u001b[28Gand how are gaits kept in step? → 1D+2D, markers (Rec.)\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1BInverse kinematic\u001b[26G is Out in scope \u001b[44Goday. What about feet and hands?\u001b[77G→ Two-bone IK, later\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRan \u001b[1m8\u001b[22m shell commands \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mRhubarb\u001b[11GLip\u001b[15GSync\u001b[20Gchecked\u001b[28Gout:\u001b[33Git's\u001b[38GMIT-licensed\u001b[51Gwith\u001b[56Gpermissive\u001b[67Gdependencies,\u001b[81Gstill\u001b[87Gmaintained,\u001b[99Gand\u001b[103Ghas\u001b[107Ga\u001b[109GLinux\u001b[115Gbuild.\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3GIts word recog\u001b[18Gition only works in\u001b[38GEnglish, \u001b[48Go for French, German and Japanese it would f\u001b[93Gll back to \u001b[105G less precise\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Blanguage-independent\u001b[24Gmode, and it fits a\u001b[44G an exte\u001b[53Gnal program the\u001b[69Gcook runs rather than\u001b[91Ga \u001b[94Ginked libr\u001b[105Gry.\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · summary\r\u001b[1B────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m←  ☒ Deform pass  ☒ Mesh nodes  ☒ Face shading \u001b[48;2;177;185;249m\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m ☐ Schedule \u001b[39m\u001b[49m ✔ Submit  →\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[2m│\u001b[3G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m\u001b[1mWhen should this track be built, against the dense geometry and ray tracing track (J36 to J50)?\r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m❯\u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m1.\u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mAfter J37 (Rec.)\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  \u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mThe cook (J37) comes first, since it must keep morph targets through optimisation and levels of detail; then this \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Btrack, before or\u001b[23Galongside J42, which then reu\u001b[54Gs\u001b[56Gits co\u001b[63Gpute\u001b[68Gpass.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m2.\u001b[6G\u001b[39mBefore J36\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mStraight away, on today's loader. The cook would then have to be taught morph targets afterwards, redoing some \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bwor\u001b[10G.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B \u001b[6GAfter the dense track\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mAfter J50.\u001b[17GJ42 would build\u001b[33Gcompute skinning wi\u001b[53Gh no morphs and this track would ex\u001b[89Gend it.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[14;1H"]
