[0.008, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m· How shoul\u001b[18G lip\u001b[23Gsync b\u001b[30G made? → At cook tim\u001b[51G (Recommended)\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1BW\u001b[10Gich blend spac\u001b[25Gs, and how are gaits k\u001b[48Gp\u001b[50G i\u001b[54Gst\u001b[57Gp? → 1D+2D,\u001b[69Gmarkers (Rec.)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m· Inverse kinema\u001b[23Gics \u001b[28Gs Out in scope\u001b[43Gtoday.\u001b[50GWhat about feet and hands? → Two-bone IK, later\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRan \u001b[1m8\u001b[22m shell commands \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mRhubarb Lip\u001b[15GSync\u001b[20Gchecked\u001b[28Gout:\u001b[33Git's\u001b[38GMIT-licensed\u001b[51Gwith\u001b[56Gpermissive\u001b[67Gdependencies,\u001b[81Gstill\u001b[87Gmaintained,\u001b[99Gand\u001b[103Ghas\u001b[107Ga\u001b[109GLinux\u001b[115Gbuild.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BIts\u001b[7Gword\u001b[12Grecognition\u001b[24Gonly\u001b[29Gworks\u001b[35Gin\u001b[38GEnglish,\u001b[47Gso\u001b[50Gfor\u001b[54GFrench,\u001b[62GGerman\u001b[69Gand\u001b[73GJapanese\u001b[82Git\u001b[85Gwould\u001b[91Gfall\u001b[96Gback\u001b[101Gto\u001b[104Ga\u001b[106Gless\u001b[111Gprecise\r\u001b[1B  language-independent mode, and it fits as an external program the cook runs rather than a linked library.\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · summary\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mAnswered\u001b[12GClaude's\u001b[21Gquestions:\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  · Where should morphing and skinning run? J42 already plans a compute pass that skins once per frame, which ray \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Btracing needs. → Compute, brought forward (Rec.)\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[4G \u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m· The rig loader refuses a model with more than one mesh node. Characters usually have several (body, eyes, teeth, \r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mclothing). Lift the limit? → Several meshes (Rec.)\r\u001b[3C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m· Portraits put faces close up. Scope has skin, hair and faces Out. What shading comes with this? → Skin, eyes, \r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[4G  \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mhair\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[3C\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m· When should this track be built, against the dense geometry and ray tracing track (J36 to J50)? → After J37 \r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[4G  \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(Rec.)\u001b[13G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[3C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✽\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;230;149;117mPouncing…\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(4m 8s · ↓\u001b[24G16.7k tokens)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[3C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;136;136;136m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── jettison-0030 ─\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;136;136;136m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m\u001b[2mOpus 5.5 ctx [#---------] 17% | 5h: 39% | ↑174.0k ↓8\r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;2;255;193;7m⏵⏵ auto mode on\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
